ix Chromebook Cert Error Flush DNS Check Hyperlift Connect Phone</span></di=
v> <!----> <div data-v-064cc47f=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-title-container-extr=
a"> <svg data-v-064cc47f=3D"" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xl=
ink=3D"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden=3D"true" role=3D"img" clas=
s=3D"iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width=3D"1em" height=3D"=
1em" viewBox=3D"0 0 1024 1024" name=3D"Right_b"><path d=3D"M681.00096 549.2=
3264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 =
0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.86=
4 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill=3D"currentColor"></path></=
svg></div></div> <div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"to=
olcall-content"><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-h=
idden=3D"true"></div><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"resize-container" s=
tyle=3D"height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-c=
ontainer"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-=
container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdow=
n"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Her phone needs to be plugged in (=
it's dead/dying). She can't do the phone test right now.</div><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Alternatives:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Chromebook DNS flush: chrome://net-internals/#d=
ns =E2=86=92 "Clear host cache" =E2=80=94 but on a Chromebook, that URL wor=
ks in Chrome. Then retry.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"aut=
o">Or simply wait for cert propagation: tell her to give it 15-30 min, then=
 refresh.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Check Hyperli=
ft Manager for SSL status: the app card has a lock icon (screenshot showed =
icons: refresh, speed/gauge, rocket?, lightning, lock, +). The lock icon mi=
ght show cert status. Their KB mentioned "Connections" for domains.</div></=
li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Simplest first step without t=
he phone: flush Chromebook DNS via chrome://net-internals/#dns. If the cert=
 error persists after that on the Chromebook AND we can't test elsewhere, t=
he likely cause is the cert still cooking =E2=80=94 then check Hyperlift pa=
nel or wait.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">One instruction: pl=
ug the phone in (it'll take a couple minutes to boot), OR meanwhile flush D=
NS. Give one step: in the address bar type chrome://net-internals/#dns, pre=
ss Enter, click "Clear host cache" button, then retry mychainlink.ca.</div>=
<div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Keep short.</div></div></div></div></=
div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D=
"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden=
=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><=
/div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__part toolcall-roll=
up__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"m=
arkdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Then let's use the Chromebook to rule itself ou=
t while the phone charges.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><stro=
ng>Step 1:</strong> In the Chromebook's address bar, type exactly:</div><di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb3=
1c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">chrome://net-internals/#dns</code></d=
iv><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Press <strong>Enter</strong>. A te=
chnical-looking page opens =E2=80=94 ignore the wall of text, just click th=
e button that says <strong>"Clear host cache"</strong>.</div><div class=3D"=
paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Then go to mychainlink.ca and refresh.</div><div cl=
ass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">If the site loads =E2=86=92 your Chromebook =
was holding stale directions, fixed. If you still get the warning =E2=86=92=
 the certificate is still baking on Spaceship's end, and we wait or check t=
he Hyperlift panel. Tell me which one you get =F0=9F=96=A4</div></div></div=
></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail"><div data=
-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail-in"><!----></div></div></di=
v> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!---->=
