 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-container"><div =
data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container toolc=
all-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The Hyperlift Manager shows "=E2=9A=A0 Connecti=
on issue" on the "HYPERLIFT MICRO for mychainlink.ca" card, and there's an =
"ISSUE" badge. The app "My Chain Link" last built Sep 14 4:06 AM. There's a=
 lock icon (green) among the icons, and a "Manage" button.</div><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">"Connection issue" =E2=80=94 this is Spaceship =
telling her the domain connection has a problem. Likely the SSL/domain conn=
ection needs attention. The "Manage" button probably opens details about th=
e connection (domain, SSL cert status).</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Next step: click "Manage" to see what the connection issue is. On=
e instruction.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade=
 scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-e=
dge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></d=
iv></div></div></div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=
=3D"toolcall-rollup__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb3=
1c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb=
31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">THERE it =
is =E2=80=94 look at that card: <strong>"=E2=9A=A0 Connection issue"</stron=
g> with an "ISSUE" badge. Spaceship itself is telling us the domain hookup =
has a problem, which confirms the certificate hunch. The good news: the app=
 rebuilt fine at 4:06 AM =E2=80=94 your code is healthy. It's just the doma=
in's security paperwork that isn't done.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Click the <strong>"Manage"</strong> butt=
on on that card (top-right of the "HYPERLIFT MICRO for mychainlink.ca" box)=
.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">That should open the connectio=
n details =E2=80=94 tell me what it says, especially anything about SSL, ce=
rtificate, or domain status. Screenshot it if you can =F0=9F=93=B8</div></d=
iv></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail"><=
