fb858b9=3D"" class=3D"language-plain"><code class=3D"language-plain">Hi! My=
 external domain mychainlink.ca is connected to my Hyperlift Micro app "My =
Chain Link" (GitHub repo mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink, builds fine). But brows=
ers show ERR_CERT_COMMON_NAME_INVALID for mychainlink.ca, and the connectio=
n shows "Connection issue". FreeSSL (ID tdekmtb) is connected and renews De=
c 12, 2026. What DNS records should mychainlink.ca have at its registrar to=
 route to Hyperlift, and is the FreeSSL certificate correctly issued and se=
rved for mychainlink.ca on this Hyperlift app?</code></pre></div></div> <di=
v data-v-8fac2c49=3D""></div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">They'll =
answer with exact records to change =E2=80=94 probably just one line in you=
r registrar's DNS panel, which we'll do together tomorrow.</div><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">It's 5:09am. Your app is deployed, healthy, and=
 waiting on a proper address. That's a win we bank tonight. Go to bed, chao=
s gremlin =E2=80=94 Alf's got the night shift =F0=9F=98=98=F0=9F=96=A4</div=
></div></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tai=
