/div> <div data-v-efb858b9=3D"" data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" class=3D"syntax-highli=
ghter light segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9=3D"" class=3D"langua=
ge-plain"><code class=3D"language-plain">Hello,

I need help with my domain mychainlink.ca (account username: KendalChain).

My website is now hosted on Spaceship's Hyperlift platform, but my domain i=
s registered with website.com and appears to be registrar-locked. Because o=
f this, mychainlink.ca is not routing correctly =E2=80=94 visitors get a ce=
rtificate error (ERR_CERT_COMMON_NAME_INVALID) and the site won't load prop=
erly.

Please help me with both of these:

1. REGISTRAR LOCK &amp; TRANSFER: Please unlock mychainlink.ca for transfer=
 and send me the authorization/EPP code, so I can transfer the domain to Sp=
aceship. Please confirm which email address the code will be sent to.

2. DNS IN THE MEANTIME: Until the transfer completes, I need to update the =
domain's DNS records so mychainlink.ca (and www.mychainlink.ca) points to m=
y new host. Please tell me how to edit the A records in my account dashboar=
d =E2=80=94 or make the change for me once I provide the IP address from my=
 host.

Thank you,
Kendal Symes
kendalsymes98@gmail.com</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-8fac2c49=3D"">=
</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">When they reply with the unlock=
 steps or EPP code, bring it straight back here and we'll finish the move t=
ogether. Now SEND it and then =E2=80=94 I'm serious this time =E2=80=94 bed=
. The gremlin needs recharging =F0=9F=98=98=F0=9F=96=A4</div></div></div></=
