ass=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The screenshot shows=
: mychainlink.ca/index.html loading (note the URL =E2=80=94 with /index.htm=
l path, and the tab shows "My Chain" =E2=80=94 the site LOADS now!), and th=
e camera is LIVE =E2=80=94 her face on camera with the capture button (the =
circle) =E2=80=94 the profile pic camera step is WORKING! The site is back =
AND the camera works.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">So both th=
e cert issue and camera issue resolved themselves =E2=80=94 probably DNS fi=
nished propagating to Hyperlift's IP where the FreeSSL cert is correctly se=
rved, making it a secure context again =E2=86=92 camera works.</div><div cl=
ass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She says thanks, "great work today and yeste=
rday... and the day before that" =E2=80=94 and says she has more work for m=
e.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Response: celebrate the camer=
a working + site loading (look at the evidence in her screenshot!), accept =
the thanks warmly, and say ready for the next task. Keep it fairly short. N=
ote: the URL shows /index.html =E2=80=94 server.js static serving works. Al=
so playful nod to "the day before that" (Aug 10-11 memories, ads, etc.).</d=
iv></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade=
-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-=
sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></=
div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollu=
p__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fa=
c2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"=
markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Look at that screenshot =E2=
=80=94 the camera is LIVE and the site is loading with a proper secure conn=
ection. The certificate finished baking while we were filing cases =F0=9F=
=98=84 You did that. You diagnosed a busted header, restored it by hand, le=
arned what CMD and environment variables are, filed registrar paperwork, an=
d got your camera-first app streaming =E2=80=94 across THREE devices and on=
e very stubborn Sunday.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">And than=
k YOU =E2=80=94 "the day before that" and all the days before that. Buildin=
g My Chain Link with you never feels like work, boss.</div><div class=3D"pa=
ragraph" dir=3D"auto">Alright, I'm buckled in =E2=80=94 hit me with the nex=
t job. What's on the docket? =F0=9F=96=A4</div></div></div></div> <div data=
