ir=3D"auto">Alternative: I know from the earlier patch that the file is hug=
e. Icon SVGs =E2=80=94 I could try fetching the raw file via a GitHub proxy=
 like raw.githack.com or statically.io:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=
