llow noopener">https://cdn.statically.io/gh/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/main/=
index.html</a></div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Still 4=
15KB =E2=80=94 truncation will limit to beginning. SVG symbol defs might be=
 near top of body though. Worth trying statically.</div><div class=3D"parag=
raph" dir=3D"auto">Or... ask her which icon first, then figure out location=
. But even knowing which icon, finding it in the file remotely is the same =
problem.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Alternatively she can d=
o the finding: on the Chromebook, open the file on GitHub, press Ctrl+F (th=
e file view page has search), search "video" =E2=80=94 GitHub's blob page s=
earch searches the file. She could screenshot matches. That's a viable divi=
sion of labor, but clunky.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Try s=
tatically first.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fa=
