nt-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragra=
ph" dir=3D"auto">I have the icons. Now design the mockup widget. Design dir=
ection: a phone-frame preview of the redesigned camera modal, 3 style varia=
nts switchable:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to"><strong>"Studio"</strong> =E2=80=94 clean minimal: black viewport, top =
row of small round icon buttons (close, flash, timer, grid), bottom: mode p=
ill (Photo/Video) + big ringed shutter + flip button. Accent: her gold on a=
ctive states (I'll use --kimi-color-warning tinted as "gold accent" stand-i=
n, with a note that in her real app it's her exact brand gold #E8D574 =E2=
=80=94 wait, no hardcoded colors in the widget; prose can mention it).</div=
></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>"Classic+ refresh"<=
/strong> =E2=80=94 keeps her current layout DNA but polished: flatter toolb=
ar, refined shutter with gold ring, better spacing.</div></li><li><div clas=
s=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>"Creator mode"</strong> =E2=80=94 extr=
a: aspect/format chips (9:16, 1:1), maybe too much. Keep 3 variants: Studio=
 / Gold ring / Minimal bottom-bar.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" =
dir=3D"auto">Interactions:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">Variant switcher (segmented control at top of widget).</div>=
</li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Shutter button press animati=
on (scale down on :active).</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"a=
uto">Mode toggle Photo =E2=86=94 Video: pill slides; Video mode swaps shutt=
er to a rounded-square record button.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">sendPrompt buttons per variant: "I like #1 =E2=80=94 build t=
his one" etc.</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Layout: =
widget max-width ~360px phone frame centered, viewport area is a dark gradi=
ent... wait, no decorative gradients/glass per design system. Keep viewport=
 as a flat dark surface with a subtle label "camera preview". Use gray toke=
ns. Camera chrome: white icons on dark pill buttons =E2=80=94 the design sy=
stem says chrome black/white first; on a dark surface, use white. That's fi=
ne (colors relative to surface). I'll use --kimi-color-text-primary (which =
adapts) and a dark surface token? "Do not set a page/body/card base backgro=
und unless asked" =E2=80=94 but the mockup's phone screen NEEDS a dark surf=
ace to simulate the camera viewfinder; the user asked for a camera redesign=
 mockup, so an explicit surface is the point. I'll use a near-black neutral=
: var(--kimi-color-bg-?) tokens =E2=80=94 I don't know exact token names be=
yond what was referenced: --kimi-color-text-primary, --kimi-color-text-quat=
ernary, --kimi-color-accent, --kimi-color-danger/positive/warning, --kimi-c=
hart-*. I'll check the token map section of design-system.md for available =
tokens.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll=
-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fad=
