048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container toolcall-con=
tent-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"parag=
raph" dir=3D"auto">I have everything. Now build the widget. Plan:</div><ul =
start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Root wrapper with fon=
t reset.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Header: segmen=
ted control with 3 variants: "Studio clean", "Gold ring", "Bottom bar".</di=
v></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Phone mockup (~320px wide,=
 rounded 16px outer, screen 12px inner radius): dark surface (--kimi-color-=
surface-strong as viewfinder =E2=80=94 a dark surface token exists; in dark=
 theme it'll be dark; in light theme it might be light... hmm. The viewfind=
er should be dark regardless. If the host is in light mode, --kimi-color-su=
rface-strong may be light gray. The camera mockup with white-on-dark chrome=
 could look off. Option: add a toggle "preview on dark" =E2=80=94 overkill.=
 I'll style chrome to use currentColor-adaptive: icons use --kimi-color-tex=
t-primary, pill buttons use color-mix 12% tint backgrounds with border. On =
the viewfinder area, put a centered label "live viewfinder" in quaternary. =
Acceptable either theme; screenshot users mostly use dark. Fine.)</div></li=
><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Common elements per variant:</di=
v><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Top bar: close =
btn (left), spacer, flash/timer/grid icon buttons =E2=80=94 variant-depende=
nt styling (Studio: small ghost pills row top; Gold ring: same but with gol=
d active state on flash; Bottom bar: minimal top =E2=80=94 just close + fli=
p).</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Bottom area: mode p=
ill (Photo | Video) with sliding indicator; shutter: big circle with ring; =
Video mode =E2=86=92 record square button; flip button (Refresh icon).</div=
></li></ul></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Interactions: mod=
e toggle JS switching shutter style + label; shutter press scale via CSS :a=
ctive; variant switch swaps a class on the phone with different CSS.</div><=
/li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">sendPrompt: each variant has =
a small "Pick this one" button =E2=86=92 sendPrompt("I pick camera design #=
N (&lt;name&gt;</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Custom=
 icons needed (no library match): flash/bolt, timer/clock, grid. I'll draw =
24=C3=9724, stroke ~1.8, currentColor, stroke-linecap round:</div><ul start=
=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">bolt: classic lightning pa=
th, filled for clarity.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"=
>timer: circle + small hand + top button nub.</div></li><li><div class=3D"p=
aragraph" dir=3D"auto">grid: 2x2 or 3x3 rounded rects.</div></li></ul><div =
class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Let me write the widget code carefully. Ke=
ep it self-contained. Also no emoji. Text labels sentence case.</div><div c=
lass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Shutter details: outer ring (border 3-4px w=
hite), inner disc white; active scale .92. Video: rounded-square (radius 6)=
 white inside ring.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Gold accent:=
 use var(--kimi-color-warning) for "active" flash in variant 2, and shutter=
 ring in variant 2 =E2=80=94 as the stand-in for her brand gold. Add tiny c=
aption under phone: "Accent shown in gold =E2=80=94 your brand gold #E8D574=
 drops in at build time." =E2=80=94 caption text ok.</div><div class=3D"par=
agraph" dir=3D"auto">Variant definitions:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div cla=
ss=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Studio clean (v-studio): top row: close | fla=
sh timer grid (ghost round 36px, tint bg 10%); bottom: centered column =E2=
=80=94 mode pill, 16px gap, shutter 68px + flip 44px beside? Layout: shutte=
r center, flip to its right. All pill buttons: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kim=
i-color-text-primary) 10%, transparent) bg, border 1px color-mix(...border =
60%).</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Gold ring (v-gold=
): same skeleton; shutter ring =3D warning token 3px; flash active =3D warn=
ing; mode pill active segment =3D warning tint bg + warning text. Caption: =
"gold accents".</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Bottom =
bar (v-bar): minimal top (close + flip only); bottom: single frosted?? no b=
lur =E2=80=94 a bottom sheet bar: surface-raised bg, radius 12, containing =
mode pill + shutter; grid/flash/timer moved into a small row above bar. Thi=
s mimics modern social apps.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D=
"auto">Height ~ 560px total. Keep compact: phone 300x~480.</div><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Write the HTML. Remember: no position fixed; no=
rmal flow. Buttons: type=3Dbutton, font inherit.</div><div class=3D"paragra=
ph" dir=3D"auto">JS: variant switching by data attr; mode toggle: class on =
phone 'mode-video' =E2=86=92 hide disc shutter show record; also label stat=
e. Add aria-pressed.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">sendPrompt =
guard: if window.sendPrompt exists.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to">Loading messages: 2, playful, same language (English). E.g., "Sketching=
 your new camera", "Polishing the shutter button". Good.</div><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Title: camera_modal_redesign.</div><div class=3D"p=
aragraph" dir=3D"auto">Let me now write code compactly but complete. I'll w=
rite CSS with tokens. Careful: color-mix with var() works in modern browser=
s.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Structure:</div><div class=3D=
"paragraph">&lt;div class=3D"wrap"&gt;
  &lt;div class=3D"seg" role=3D"tablist"&gt; 3 buttons &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=3D"phone v-studio" id=3D"phone"&gt;
    &lt;div class=3D"vf"&gt;&lt;span class=3D"vf-label"&gt;live viewfinder&=
lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=3D"topbar"&gt; close | spacer | flash timer grid &lt;/div=
&gt;
    &lt;div class=3D"bottom"&gt;
       &lt;div class=3D"modepill"&gt;&lt;button photo active&gt;Photo&lt;/b=
utton&gt;&lt;button video&gt;Video&lt;/button&gt;&lt;span class=3D"slider"&=
gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
       &lt;div class=3D"controls"&gt;&lt;button flip&gt;..&lt;/button&gt;&l=
t;button shutter&gt;&lt;span class=3D"disc"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;=
&lt;button grid?&gt;...=20
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;p class=3D"cap"&gt;accent preview uses gold...&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;button class=3D"pick"&gt;Pick this design&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Simplify controls r=
ow: flip | shutter | (grid or timer depending variant?) Keep: flip left of =
shutter. For v-bar, flash/timer/grid live in a row above the mode pill.</di=
v><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Video mode: shutter becomes record =
button (square). Use .mode-video on phone: .disc hidden, .rec shown.</div><=
div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Slider position: .mode-video .slider {=
 translateX(100%) }.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Pick button=
: label includes variant name; sendPrompt(<code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v=
-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">I pick camera design "${name}"=
 =E2=80=94 let's build it into My Chain Link</code>).</div><div class=3D"pa=
ragraph" dir=3D"auto">Add subtle press animation on shutter: transition tra=
nsform var(--t-fast) var(--ease-out); :active{transform:scale(.9)}.</div><d=
iv class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Topbar buttons 36px circle radius full;=
 icon 20px.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Bottom spacing scale=
 8/12/16.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Phone frame: border 1p=
x var(--kimi-color-border); border-radius 24px outer; padding 12px; inner s=
creen radius 16-12=3D... outer 24, padding 12 =E2=86=92 inner radius 12. Sc=
reen bg: --kimi-color-surface-strong.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"=
auto">Viewfinder label: centered, quaternary, small caption =E2=80=94 repre=
sents where live camera feed shows.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to">v-gold: .shutter{border-color: var(--kimi-color-warning)} .flash.on use=
s warning... I'll make flash button pre-toggled "on" state in gold variant =
only, showing the accent.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Also a=
dd per-variant micro-note under phone? The caption updates with variant nam=
e via JS.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Write it.</div></div><=
/div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" a=
ria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" =
aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!---=
