=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-title-name-text">Resolve duplicated camera preview =
and direct user to widget variants</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-064cc47=
f=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-064cc47f=3D"" =
xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink=3D"http://www.w3.org/1999/=
xlink" aria-hidden=3D"true" role=3D"img" class=3D"iconify toolcall-title-co=
ntainer-extra-arrow" width=3D"1em" height=3D"1em" viewBox=3D"0 0 1024 1024"=
 name=3D"Right_b"><path d=3D"M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.081=
92-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.68=
64 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.=
696-287.744z" fill=3D"currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-b=
90066f2=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-content"><div class=3D"=
scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div data=
-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"resize-container" style=3D"height: 0px; opacity: =
0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=
=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container toolcall-content-tex=
t"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" di=
r=3D"auto">New screenshot shows a bug: the camera modal is rendering weirdl=
y =E2=80=94 the video feed appears twice, with a big black bar. Looks like:=
 the camera modal opens at half height (bottom ~40% of screen shows the cam=
era with her face in the feed, toolbar with flip/flash/shutter/grid), while=
 above it there's another stretched video element showing the top part of h=
er (duplicated feed, warped). So the modal is broken layout-wise: probably =
<code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inlin=
e">height:50vh</code> or the video element is duplicated/stretched =E2=80=
=94 a full-bleed <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"s=
egment-code-inline">&lt;video&gt;</code> behind plus the modal partial. Thi=
s aligns with her complaint that the camera modal looks outdated/broken =E2=
=80=94 "see it also does this."</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
So now I have TWO things: my widget mockup (already shown) for the redesign=
, and this layout bug. The screenshot shows the modal occupying only the bo=
ttom portion with duplicated video =E2=80=94 likely a CSS issue: modal is p=
ositioned at bottom with height 50% and object-fit problems, plus maybe a s=
econd video preview element fullscreen behind.</div><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">My response: acknowledge the bug =E2=80=94 the camera is pai=
nting itself twice (a full-stretched copy up top + the actual modal below).=
 That's a CSS layout bug, not her. It'll be fixed as part of the redesign =
=E2=80=94 one more reason to rebuild the modal properly.</div><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Then pivot to the widget: the mockup is up there =
=E2=80=94 she should flip through the 3 variants and tap "Pick this design"=
. Ask which one. Keep it brief.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
Note meta timestamp: 20:29 +08:00 =E2=80=94 she's still going.</div></div><=
/div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" a=
ria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" =
aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!---=
-> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__part to=
olcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D""=
 class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown">=
<div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Oh that's gnarly =E2=80=94 look at it=
, the camera is literally painting itself <strong>twice</strong>: a stretch=
ed duplicate up top and the real modal squished in the bottom half. That's =
a layout bug in the old modal's CSS (its height is set to only half the scr=
een and the video is bleeding behind it), not anything you did. File it und=
er "more reasons this modal gets rebuilt from scratch" =F0=9F=97=82=EF=B8=
=8F</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">And good timing =E2=80=94 th=
e look-book is sitting up in our chat =E2=98=9D=EF=B8=8F Three vibes to fli=
p through: <strong>Studio clean</strong>, <strong>Gold ring</strong> (your =
brand gold on the shutter), and <strong>Bottom sheet</strong> (modern socia=
l-app style). Tap the shutter, flip between Photo and Video, see how it fee=
ls.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Which one's speaking to you,=
 art director? And if none of them are quite it, tell me what to change =E2=
=80=94 more minimal, more gold, different button shapes =E2=80=94 it's your=
 canvas =F0=9F=8E=A8</div></div></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" clas=
s=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail"><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rol=
lup__tail-in"><!----></div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!--=
--> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-4a069cdc=3D"" class=3D"ok=
c-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!=
