onfirm Vine-style square camera ask about tall videos and Claw credits</spa=
n></div> <!----> <div data-v-064cc47f=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-title-containe=
r-extra"> <svg data-v-064cc47f=3D"" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xm=
