er-extra-arrow" width=3D"1em" height=3D"1em" viewBox=3D"0 0 1024 1024" name=
=3D"Right_b"><path d=3D"M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52=
.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 25=
