iv data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"=
auto">She decided: keep it tall (portrait), not square. So the spec: Vine-s=
tyle camera with tall/portrait video, gold ring, segmented record ring, gho=
st tool, minimal chrome.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Still p=
ending: her sending the camera code map (step 1 =E2=80=94 search "camera" a=
nd screenshot). She hasn't done that yet; she just answered the square/tall=
 question.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Acknowledge the decis=
ion, fold it into the spec, and re-point her to step 1 (the search screensh=
ot). Keep short.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fa=
