is =E2=80=94 modern feeds win, Vine <em>soul</em> without the square crop. =
Noted in the blueprint: =F0=9F=93=90 <strong>portrait loops, gold segment r=
ing, ghost tool, clean chrome.</strong></div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Now I need that map, art director. One tiny step:</div><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=91=89 <a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"=
