6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">camera</code> in =
the <strong>"Search within code"</strong> box =E2=86=92 screenshot what pop=
s up.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">That screenshot is my eyes=
 into your file. Send it and I'll tell you exactly which block to copy-past=
e back to me =F0=9F=97=BA=EF=B8=8F=E2=9C=A8</div></div></div></div> <div da=
