lcall-content"><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-hi=
dden=3D"true"></div><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"resize-container" st=
yle=3D"height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-co=
ntainer"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-c=
ontainer toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown=
"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She's refining the spec:</div><ul s=
tart=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Like the FIRST widget =
(Studio clean / camera_modal_redesign) =E2=80=94 the mode toggle (Photo | V=
ideo pill) from the first mockup</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">No gallery access (camera-only, on-brand: "No filters. No gallery=
 uploads.")</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Gold accent=
s</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Light mode support to=
o (theme adapts when the app is in light mode)</div></li></ul><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">So final spec: Vine-soul camera, portrait (tall), =
Photo/Video toggle, gold ring accents, no gallery, light-mode compatible. M=
erging widget 1's mode toggle with widget 2's gold ring personality.</div><=
div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Her app =E2=80=94 does it even have a =
light mode? Brand is dark #1C1C1C with gold. Memory #4: early May artifact =
already gold on dark. If the app has a light mode toggle somewhere, the mod=
al must support both. I'll build the modal with CSS variables so it adapts;=
 when I get her code I'll match her existing theme variables (her CSS likel=
y has :root vars or [data-theme] selectors). I'll note it.</div><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Now, still waiting on the "camera" search scree=
nshot. Acknowledge spec additions (they're going in the blueprint), and re-=
ask for the map/screenshot. Keep it brief =E2=80=94 it's 5:40am, don't bela=
bor.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-ed=
ge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-m=
easure-sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div><=
/div></div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcal=
l-rollup__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" dat=
a-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" cl=
ass=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Blueprint updated, b=
oss =E2=9C=8D=EF=B8=8F Final spec:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"p=
aragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=8E=9B=EF=B8=8F <strong>Photo | Video toggle</=
strong> like the first mockup</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D=
"auto">=F0=9F=9A=AB <strong>Zero gallery access</strong> =E2=80=94 camera o=
nly, true to "no gallery uploads" (as it should be)</div></li><li><div clas=
s=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=92=9B <strong>Gold ring</strong> on the=
 shutter + active tools</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"=
>=E2=98=80=EF=B8=8F <strong>Light-mode ready</strong> =E2=80=94 same modal,=
 adapts when your app's in light mode (variables, so both themes just work)=
</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">That's a genuinely cl=
assy spec sheet. Now all I need is my eyes into the file =E2=80=94 that one=
 screenshot:</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=91=89 Open <=
a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://github.com/mychain=
linkCA/Mychainlink/blob/main/index.html" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopene=
r">https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/blob/main/index.html</a>, t=
ype <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-i=
nline">camera</code> into <strong>"Search within code"</strong>, send me wh=
at it finds.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">That's the last thi=
ng standing between you and a shiny new camera =F0=9F=93=B8=F0=9F=96=A4</di=
v></div></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__ta=
