"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She wants the 6-second loop limit k=
ept (Vine's signature 6s). Add to spec: videos capped at 6 seconds, segment=
ed ring (6 segments of 1s each filling as you record).</div><div class=3D"p=
aragraph" dir=3D"auto">Spec is now complete:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div =
class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Vine-soul camera, portrait tall video</div=
></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">6-second max loops, segment=
ed gold ring (6 =C3=97 1s)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to">Photo | Video toggle</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto=
">No gallery</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Gold accen=
ts, light-mode ready</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Gh=
ost tool? She didn't mention; the first widget didn't have it. Keep spec to=
 what she asked: toggle, gold, 6s, no gallery, light mode. (Ghost was from =
the vine mock; she referenced the FIRST example as the base. I'll drop ghos=
t to keep it simple =E2=80=94 or keep? Don't add scope creep; she said "lik=
e the first example." Skip ghost.)</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" =
dir=3D"auto">Still waiting on the search screenshot. Acknowledge + re-ask f=
or the map. Keep very short.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"sc=
