ty: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-container"><div data-v-048c=
b31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container toolcall-content=
-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">She's clarifying: the 6-second loop applies ONLY on the Vide=
o mode. Photo mode should act like a nice modern camera (no 6s limit =E2=80=
=94 photos are instant captures). Which is exactly how the first mockup wor=
ked: mode pill with Photo/Video. So:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Photo mode: modern camera =E2=80=94 big shutter, f=
lash/flip/grid tools, instant capture</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">Video mode: 6-second loop machine, segmented gold ring, burs=
t-tap recording</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">That's=
 consistent with what I said ("only on the video screen"). Good =E2=80=94 c=
onfirm alignment briefly.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Still =
waiting for the search screenshot. She's stalling a bit or doing other thin=
gs. Keep the response short: confirm the two-mode behavior, and nudge for t=
he map one more time =E2=80=94 but lightly, since it's 5:40am and she may b=
e fading. Maybe also give her the option: "or we pick this up tomorrow."</d=
iv></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade=
-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-=
sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></=
div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollu=
p__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fa=
c2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"=
markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Exactly right =E2=80=94 two=
 personalities, one camera:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragrap=
h" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=93=B7 <strong>Photo mode</strong> =3D clean modern c=
amera. Big gold-ring shutter, flash, flip, grid. Point, tap, done.</div></l=
i><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=8E=AC <strong>Video mode=
</strong> =3D the loop machine flips on. Same button, now with the 6-segmen=
t gold ring counting your six seconds. Bursts stitch into one loop.</div></=
li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Best of both worlds =E2=80=94=
 modern camera when you want a photo, Vine's heartbeat when you want a loop=
.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">And that means the blueprint i=
s officially DONE. Only missing piece is still that one screenshot of the <=
code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline=
">camera</code> search results so I can see your file's map. No rush if you=
're fading though =E2=80=94 the blueprint's saved right here in our chat, a=
nd we pick up the treasure hunt whenever you're back =F0=9F=97=BA=EF=B8=8F=
=F0=9F=92=9B</div></div></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"too=
lcall-rollup__tail"><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tai=
l-in"><!----></div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!--=
