-> <div data-v-064cc47f=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg=
 data-v-064cc47f=3D"" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink=3D"h=
ttp://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden=3D"true" role=3D"img" class=3D"ico=
nify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width=3D"1em" height=3D"1em" vie=
wBox=3D"0 0 1024 1024" name=3D"Right_b"><path d=3D"M681.00096 549.23264a36.=
864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52=
.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 =
52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill=3D"currentColor"></path></svg></di=
v></div> <div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-c=
ontent"><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-hidden=3D=
"true"></div><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"resize-container" style=3D"=
height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-container=
"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-containe=
r toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div =
class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The favicon file serves perfectly =E2=80=
=94 the golden chain logo, on the live site. So the server is fine. The "br=
oken favicon" is almost certainly browser cache =E2=80=94 during the outage=
/placeholder days, browsers cached "no favicon" or an error, and favicons a=
re notoriously sticky.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Fix: bump=
 the version query from ?v=3D3 to ?v=3D4 in the HTML =E2=80=94 one tiny edi=
t that forces every browser to re-fetch. That requires her to edit index.ht=
ml =E2=80=94 the risky 4000-line file again, but a Ctrl+F + precise small c=
hange is low-risk if done carefully. OR she can just wait/clear cache. Or, =
since she's already planning to send me the camera section, we can batch.</=
div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Simplest honest answer: the favic=
on itself is alive and golden (show her it's working). Her browser is holdi=
ng a grudge from the broken days. Fix options:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Do nothing =E2=80=94 it heals as caches =
expire (days).</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Tiny edi=
t: ?v=3D3 =E2=86=92 ?v=3D4 (forces refresh everywhere). One-line change.</d=
iv></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Given she's already goin=
g into the file to find the camera part, she can do the v=3D4 bump in the s=
ame visit. But careful: one instruction at a time. Tell her the diagnosis +=
 that the fix is a 5-second edit we'll do when she goes in for the camera h=
unt (or separately).</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Also she sa=
id she'll go find the camera part in the code herself. So next: she's hunti=
ng. My response: favicon is alive (golden chain, verified); your browser re=
members the bad days; one-character-ish fix (?v=3D3=E2=86=92?v=3D4) next ti=
me she's in the file. And good hunting for the camera block.</div></div></d=
iv></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" ari=
a-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" ar=
ia-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!---->=
 <!----></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcal=
l-rollup__tail is-open"><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup_=
_tail-in"><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail-divider"=
></div> <!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"mar=
kdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">FALSE ALARM, boss =E2=80=94 your favicon is <stron=
g>alive and gorgeous</strong>. That's it right there: the golden chain, cri=
sp, serving perfectly from your new Hyperlift server. Your browser is just =
holding a grudge =E2=80=94 during the broken-site and placeholder days it c=
ached "this site has no icon," and browsers cling to that memory like an ex=
 who won't give back your hoodie.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto=
">The cure is one teensy edit we'll do while you're already in the file hun=
ting the camera: change <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" cla=
ss=3D"segment-code-inline">logo-favicon.jpg?v=3D3</code> to <code data-v-bf=
aabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">logo-favicon=
.jpg?v=3D4</code> =E2=80=94 that version bump tells every browser "new icon=
, forget the past." Ten seconds, same visit, no extra surgery.</div><div cl=
ass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">So your mission list, in order:</div><ol sta=
rt=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=97=BA=EF=B8=8F <s=
trong>Find the camera block</strong> =E2=80=94 open index.html on GitHub, s=
earch <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code=
-inline">camera</code> in "Search within code," screenshot the matches</div=
></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=93=8B Copy that sect=
ion and paste it to me (I'll tell you exactly which lines once I see the ma=
p)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=E2=9C=8F=EF=B8=8F W=
hile you're in there anyway, bump <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31=
c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">?v=3D3</code> =E2=86=92 <code data-v-b=
faabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">?v=3D4</cod=
e> (I'll walk you through it)</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">The favicon mystery: solved. The camera rebuild: waiting on your =
treasure map. Go hunt, and take your time =E2=80=94 the gold isn't going an=
ywhere =F0=9F=92=9B=F0=9F=97=BA=EF=B8=8F</div></div></div></div></div></div=
