ss=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She adds: stories should have the same 4-seco=
nd loop setup as video posts. So stories =3D 4s loops too, same camera beha=
vior. Add to spec.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Current spec =
board:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Camer=
a modal rebuild: Photo mode (modern camera) / Video mode (4s gold-segment l=
oops, burst-stitch)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Sto=
ries: same 4s loop setup</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto=
">Video chats: regular live video, no cap</div></li><li><div class=3D"parag=
raph" dir=3D"auto">No gallery access</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph"=
 dir=3D"auto">Gold accents, light-mode ready</div></li><li><div class=3D"pa=
ragraph" dir=3D"auto">Fixes the double-video layout bug</div></li><li><div =
class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Favicon: ?v=3D4 bump when she's in the fil=
e</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Waiting on: her camer=
a search screenshot + section copy</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" =
dir=3D"auto">Short acknowledgment. Keep the board updated, remind of the on=
e pending action (camera map).</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"=
scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div c=
lass=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div=
