auto">Locked in =E2=80=94 <strong>stories get the same 4-second gold-loop t=
reatment.</strong> One camera, one heartbeat: shoot a burst, it stitches in=
to a 4s loop, and it lands wherever you pointed it =E2=80=94 feed or story.=
 Consistent, fast, on-brand =F0=9F=93=96=F0=9F=92=9B</div><div class=3D"par=
agraph" dir=3D"auto">Updated build board:</div><div data-v-c0e67cf3=3D"" da=
