a-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
She wants the link preview (Open Graph image) to show her logo when sending=
 mychainlink.ca =E2=80=94 like the link previews she saw in her DM screensh=
ot (cleanedbykendal.ca showed a preview card, mychainlink.ca showed plain "=
<a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"http://mychainlink.ca/" r=
el=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">http://mychainlink.ca</a>"). This is th=
e og:image / social meta tags.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">H=
er head currently has (from the restored header):</div><div data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9=3D""=
 data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" class=3D"sticky-release" style=3D"--sticky-header-hei=
ght: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9=3D"" class=3D"sticky-release-rail"><div =
