</div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9=3D"" data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" class=3D"=
syntax-highlighter light segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9=3D"" cl=
ass=3D"language-plain"><code class=3D"language-plain">&lt;meta name=3D"desc=
ription" content=3D"My Chain Link - get connected, stay connected. No filte=
rs. No gallery uploads. Real people only."&gt;</code></pre></div></div> <di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">But NO Open Graph tags (og:title, og:des=
cription, og:image, og:url, twitter:card). That's why no rich preview.</div=
><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Fix: add OG meta tags to the &lt;hea=
d&gt;</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Ideal: a proper 1200=C3=97=
630 OG banner. I could BUILD one for her! I have the ads pipeline experienc=
e (memory #10: built 8 social ads via HTML+CSS+base64 photos+headless Chrom=
ium). I can generate an og-image.png (1200=C3=97630) with ipython + headles=
s chromium using her logo-v4.png pulled from GitHub... wait, ipython has NO=
 network access. Hmm. "No network." So I can't download her logo into ipyth=
on. But I can fetch the logo via web_open_url (it rendered the jpg as an im=
age!). Can I get logo-v4.png saved to /mnt/agents/output? web_open_url disp=
lays it but doesn't save. Hmm =E2=80=94 search_image_by_image? No.</div><di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Wait =E2=80=94 ipython says "No network"=
 =E2=80=94 can't download. But maybe the fetch tool can return image to me =
visually only. I could rebuild the logo in pure CSS/HTML (gold chain emoji?=
 no...). Actually the logo is a gold chain + wordmark =E2=80=94 hard to rec=
reate exactly without the asset.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"=
>Alternative: create the OG image directly with PIL: gold gradient chain li=
nks? I can draw a decent gold chain link with PIL (rounded rectangles + gra=
dients). Or simpler: black background + gold text wordmark "My Chain Link" =
+ tagline in a nice font =E2=80=94 clean and brand-consistent. PIL with fon=
ts: Chinese fonts pre-configured; DejaVu likely available. A minimal, class=
y OG: charcoal bg (#1C1C1C =E2=80=94 her brand bg), gold chain-link glyph d=
rawn with PIL arcs/rounded rects, wordmark text, tagline. Doable.</div><div=
 class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">But wait =E2=80=94 how does the PNG get i=
nto her repo? She'd need to upload it via GitHub web (upload file =E2=80=94=
 easy: "Add file =E2=86=92 Upload files", drag-drop). That's a very doable =
step for her. Then add the meta tags.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"=
auto">But hold on =E2=80=94 scope check. She's mid-flow, 5:43am. The OG ima=
ge is a nice deliverable I can actually produce RIGHT NOW (file in /mnt/age=
nts/output). Plan:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D=
"auto">Generate og-image.png 1200=C3=97630 in ipython (PIL): brand-dark bg,=
 gold chain mark (draw two interlocked rounded-rect links with gold gradien=
t), "My Chain Link" wordmark text, tagline "Get connected. Stay connected."=
 =E2=80=94 sentence case per... her brand uses caps; the site's tagline is =
"Get connected. Stay connected." Keep that.</div></li><li><div class=3D"par=
agraph" dir=3D"auto">Give her the meta tags block to paste in &lt;head&gt;<=
/div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Fonts: check what's av=
ailable in PIL (DejaVuSans-Bold). A cleaner look might need a nicer font =
=E2=80=94 check for Inter or similar in the environment. I'll check font fi=
les.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Chain links drawing: two ro=
unded rectangles (pill shapes) rotated 45=C2=B0, interlocked, with golden g=
radient fill (linear gradient from #f5e08c to #c9a227 via numpy), plus high=
light. PIL: create gradient, mask with rounded-rect rotated. Doable with nu=
mpy + PIL.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Let me build it. Also=
 make a favicon? No =E2=80=94 scope. OG image only.</div><div class=3D"para=
graph" dir=3D"auto">Also note the meta tags reference /og-image.png absolut=
e URL: <a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://mychainlin=
k.ca/og-image.png" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">https://mychainlink=
.ca/og-image.png</a>.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Meta block=
:</div><div data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code=
"><div data-v-13fde6a9=3D"" data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" class=3D"sticky-release" s=
tyle=3D"--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9=3D"" class=3D=
