iv></div> <div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-=
content"><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-hidden=
=3D"true"></div><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"resize-container" style=
=3D"height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-conta=
iner"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-cont=
ainer toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><=
div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The banner looks great =E2=80=94 real =
logo, charcoal bg, subtle gold glow, tagline. Deliverable ready at /mnt/age=
nts/output/og-image.png.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Now the=
 steps for her:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to">Download og-image.png from our chat (she can click/download the file)</=
div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Upload to GitHub repo ro=
ot (Add file =E2=86=92 Upload files, drag-drop) =E2=80=94 so it lives at <a=
 data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://mychainlink.ca/og-i=
mage.png" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">https://mychainlink.ca/og-im=
age.png</a></div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Add meta ta=
gs to &lt;head&gt;</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Note=
: link preview caches =E2=80=94 Facebook/Messenger/WhatsApp cache previews;=
 may take hours/days or need re-scrape. iMessage reads og tags too.</div></=
li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Give the meta block (full cod=
e) and instructions. Also remind that this needs Hyperlift rebuild? No =E2=
=80=94 static file + HTML change: HTML edit needs... server.js serves stati=
c files directly from disk; changes to index.html in repo require a REBUILD=
 on Hyperlift (it pulls from GitHub at build time). Right! Important: any i=
ndex.html change now requires a Hyperlift build to go live. That's a new wo=
rkflow fact =E2=80=94 every edit =3D commit + Build button in Hyperlift. Im=
portant to tell her.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Keep it org=
anized but brief. Deliver file tag at end. Steps:</div><div class=3D"paragr=
aph" dir=3D"auto">Step 1: Download the image below (it'll appear as a file =
in chat)
Step 2: Upload to repo root
Step 3: Paste meta tags (I'll guide where, or batch with camera work =E2=80=
=94 but this is independent and small; could guide now... one step at a tim=
e per memory. Give Step 1+2 now? Upload is one action. Then meta paste afte=
r. Keep momentum: give upload step now.)</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Actually, combine smartly: this turn =3D deliver image + Step 1 (=
upload to GitHub). Next turn =3D meta tags paste guide (exact anchor: right=
 after the description meta line I restored =E2=80=94 I know the exact cont=
ext!). The anchor: the line <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D""=
 class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;meta name=3D"description" content=3D"My =
Chain Link - get connected, stay connected. No filters. No gallery uploads.=
 Real people only."&gt;</code> =E2=80=94 she pastes the OG block right afte=
r it. That's a safe, well-defined edit.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Also mention: after these edits go in, click Build in Hyperlift f=
or them to go live.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge=
-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scr=
oll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></di=
v></div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div dat=
a-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail is-open"><div data-v-0a722=
276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail-in"><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=
=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail-divider"></div> <!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D""=
 data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"=
" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">THAT'S the one =
=F0=9F=94=97=E2=9C=A8 Your real logo, gold glow, charcoal canvas =E2=80=94 =
that's your business card now.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">H=
ere's how it goes live (one step now, one after):</div><div class=3D"paragr=
aph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Download the image from this cha=
t, then upload it to your repo:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"para=
graph" dir=3D"auto">Go to =F0=9F=91=89 <a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_b=
lank" href=3D"https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/upload/main" rel=
=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainl=
ink/upload/main</a></div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Dra=
g <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inl=
ine">og-image.png</code> into the drop zone</div></li><li><div class=3D"par=
agraph" dir=3D"auto">Click the green <strong>Commit changes</strong> button=
</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Once it's committed, =
the image will live at <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" clas=
s=3D"segment-code-inline">https://mychainlink.ca/og-image.png</code>.</div>=
<div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Then Step 2</strong> (next me=
ssage from me): a tiny paste into your <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-04=
8cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;head&gt;</code> that tells ev=
ery messenger "show this image when my link is shared" =E2=80=94 right afte=
r the description line, takes 30 seconds.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F One new workflow fact for the Hyperlift era: <=
strong>your website files only update when you hit the Build button</strong=
> in the Hyperlift Manager. GitHub is the blueprint; Hyperlift is the const=
ruction crew. So after any index.html edit, we click Build to make it live.=
</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Upload that image and tell me w=
hen it's committed =F0=9F=92=9B</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
