te: current openCam uses <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" cl=
ass=3D"segment-code-inline">audio:false</code> =E2=80=94 so recorded videos=
 are SILENT. That's a real bug worth fixing: audio:true. MediaRecorder with=
 audio track records sound. In photo mode the mic is on too (privacy-wise s=
ame as video calls). I'll set audio:true and mention it (fixing silent vide=
os =E2=80=94 she'll love that catch).</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"=
