eft, [flash + X] right grouped. Adjust HTML: left group (flip), right group=
 (flash, X). Simplest: two spans.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto=
">Also mode pill: in old flow, cam-c (dock) hidden during strip/capture-mod=
e. Mode pill should also hide when strip shown? Multi-photo strip shows at =
