(separate element) would still show during multi-photo. Minor overlap: pill=
 bottom:136px, strip bottom:150px =E2=80=94 collision. Solution: hide pill =
when strip active. Add to snap(): <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31=
c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">$('cam-modes').style.display=3D'none'<=
/code> and addAnotherPhoto/finishCapture/retakeLastPhoto-when-empty restore=
 'flex'. Manage via helper. Let me integrate: in snap() after showing strip=
: modes hidden. In addAnotherPhoto: modes visible again (display flex). In =
finishCapture: modes stay hidden (preview comes up). In retakeLastPhoto whe=
n photos empty =E2=86=92 cam-c shown; also modes visible. In retake() (full=
 reset): modes visible.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Simpler:=
