 duplicate declaration later in old block; my new block declares once.</div=
><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">For the response message: short summ=
ary of what I found (including the silent-video bug catch and missing style=
s causing the jank), then 3 files with paste instructions (concise, one blo=
ck at a time), then commit + Build. Given "one instruction per message" mem=
ory vs efficiency =E2=80=94 I'll lay out the sequence but tell her we go on=
e paste at a time, starting with CSS. Keep the response focused: files deli=
vered + Step 1 only (CSS paste), next steps after confirmation.</div><div c=
