name-text">Commit three edits together build give landmarks screenshot if n=
eeded</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-064cc47f=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-titl=
e-container-extra"> <svg data-v-064cc47f=3D"" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/20=
00/svg" xmlns:xlink=3D"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden=3D"true" r=
ole=3D"img" class=3D"iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width=3D=
"1em" height=3D"1em" viewBox=3D"0 0 1024 1024" name=3D"Right_b"><path d=3D"=
M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.4764=
8a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69=
344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill=3D"current=
Color"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=
=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-content"><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge=
-fade-top" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"re=
size-container" style=3D"height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"=
" class=3D"slot-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" c=
lass=3D"markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D""=
 class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She asks: can she=
 commit all three changes at the same time (do all three pastes, then one c=
ommit)?</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Yes =E2=80=94 actually t=
hat's BETTER: one commit =3D one clean revert point if anything goes sidewa=
ys. The GitHub web editor session accumulates all her edits; she can paste =
CSS, HTML, JS replacements and hit Commit once. That's safer (atomic) =E2=
=80=94 mixing states doesn't matter since nothing goes live until she hits =
Build in Hyperlift anyway.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">So: y=
es, do all three pastes in one editing session, commit once. Then Build. Gi=
ve her the three landmarks compactly and let her go. Remind: don't panic-sc=
roll; if something looks off, screenshot before committing.</div></div></di=
v></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria=
-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" ari=
a-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----> =
<!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__part toolc=
all-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" cl=
ass=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Actually yes =E2=80=94 and honestly that=
's the <em>smarter</em> move, boss. One commit =3D one clean undo button if=
 anything hiccups. GitHub holds all three edits in the same session, and no=
thing goes live until we hit Build in Hyperlift anyway. Go for it.</div><di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">All three landmarks, in order:</div><ol =
start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Wardrobe (CSS=
):</strong> search <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D=
"segment-code-inline">/* =3D=3D=3D CAMERA</code> =E2=86=92 highlight to jus=
t before <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-c=
ode-inline">/* =3D=3D=3D PROFILE</code> =E2=86=92 replace with <strong>file=
 1</strong></div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Ske=
leton (HTML):</strong> search <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D=
"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;!-- CAMERA OVERLAY --&gt;</code> =E2=
=86=92 highlight to just before <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=
=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;!-- LIGHTBOX --&gt;</code> =E2=86=
=92 replace with <strong>file 2</strong></div></li><li><div class=3D"paragr=
aph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Brain (JS):</strong> search <code data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D CAMERA</code> =E2=86=92 highl=
ight to just before <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=
=3D"segment-code-inline">var editingPostId=3Dnull;</code> =E2=86=92 replace=
 with <strong>file 3</strong></div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Then <strong>one Commit</strong> (default message is fine).</div>=
<div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F If anything looks =
weird mid-paste =E2=80=94 wrong spot, weird selection =E2=80=94 <strong>scr=
eenshot first, don't commit.</strong> We fix, then commit. Nothing is live =
until Build.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">When it's committed=
, tell me and we flip the switch together =F0=9F=8E=AC=F0=9F=92=9B</div></d=
iv></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail"><=
div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail-in"><!----></div></=
div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->  =
