064cc47f=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-title-name-text">Commit Once for Cleaner Wo=
rkflow on Chromebook</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-064cc47f=3D"" class=
=3D"toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-064cc47f=3D"" xmlns=3D"htt=
p://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink=3D"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-=
hidden=3D"true" role=3D"img" class=3D"iconify toolcall-title-container-extr=
a-arrow" width=3D"1em" height=3D"1em" viewBox=3D"0 0 1024 1024" name=3D"Rig=
ht_b"><path d=3D"M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L3=
95.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736=
-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z=
" fill=3D"currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-b90066f2=3D""=
 data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-content"><div class=3D"scroll-edge-=
fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div data-v-b90066f2=
=3D"" class=3D"resize-container" style=3D"height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div da=
ta-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-=
v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div dat=
a-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
GitHub froze. It's 07:15. She was mid-edit on her phone. Guidance:</div><ol=
 start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Give it a minute, th=
en if still frozen, close the tab.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" d=
ir=3D"auto">Reopen <a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https:=
//github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/edit/main/index.html" rel=3D"norefer=
rer nofollow noopener">https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/edit/ma=
in/index.html</a> fresh.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto=
">Check if pastes survived (probably not =E2=80=94 web editor doesn't autos=
ave).</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">If lost: re-paste=
 the three files. This time, maybe do them one at a time with a commit afte=
r each? That contradicts the atomic advice, but for a phone editor, smaller=
 sessions =3D less freeze risk. Actually better alternative: do the edits o=
n the Chromebook (desktop editor handles the file better) =E2=80=94 strongl=
y recommend that. It's 7:15am; she has a Chromebook.</div></li></ol><div cl=
ass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Key recommendation: switch to the Chromebook=
 for this surgery. The phone editor freezing on a 415KB file will keep happ=
ening.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Steps:</div><ol start=3D"=
1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Close frozen tab (edits likely=
 lost =E2=80=94 fine, files safe).</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" d=
ir=3D"auto">On Chromebook, open the edit link.</div></li><li><div class=3D"=
paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Do the three pastes, commit once.</div></li></ol><d=
iv class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Or one paste + commit at a time on Chro=
mebook as compromise? On desktop the editor handles it fine; one commit is =
cleaner. Go one-and-done on Chromebook.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Keep it short, reassuring.</div></div></div></div></div> <div cla=
ss=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div>=
<div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div=
></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-=
v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!---=
-> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-contain=
er"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" d=
ir=3D"auto">Okay =E2=80=94 GitHub froze, that means the phone editor choked=
 on the big file. No harm done. The three files are safe in our chat; the e=
dit just didn't get committed.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">H=
ere's the move, and it's an easy one:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Close the frozen tab.</strong> (Whateve=
r was mid-paste evaporates =E2=80=94 that's fine.)</div></li><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Switch to the Chromebook.</strong> Its =
editor chews 4,000-line files without breaking a sweat =E2=80=94 the phone =
was always going to struggle with surgery this size.</div></li><li><div cla=
ss=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">On the Chromebook, open =F0=9F=91=89 <a data-=
v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/=
Mychainlink/edit/main/index.html" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">http=
s://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/edit/main/index.html</a> and do th=
e three pastes (the landmarks from before =E2=80=94 CAMERA =E2=86=92 PROFIL=
E, CAMERA OVERLAY =E2=86=92 LIGHTBOX, the JS marker =E2=86=92 editingPostId=
), then <strong>one Commit</strong>.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">Same plan, steadier hands. And hey =E2=80=94 worst case, the=
 site is untouched and working right now, so there's no clock ticking. Take=
 your time, and shout if any landmark doesn't appear where you expect it =
=F0=9F=8E=AC=F0=9F=92=9B</div></div></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" =
class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail"><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall=
-rollup__tail-in"><!----></div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  =
