v data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=3D"slot-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" d=
ata-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div=
 data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to">She removed the duplicate comment line already. Good. Now file 3 (JS). =
Instructions: search <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=
=3D"segment-code-inline">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D CAMERA</code> (the old marker =E2=80=94 wait, after file 1 =
paste, the CSS has <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D=
"segment-code-inline">/* =3D=3D=3D CAMERA v2 ...</code> but the JS marker <=
code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline=
">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D CAMERA =
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D</code> still e=
xists unchanged until she replaces it). Start anchor: <code data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D CAMERA =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D</code> (find in editor). End anchor=
: <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inl=
ine">var editingPostId=3Dnull;</code>. Select from start marker through the=
 line before that, delete, paste file 3.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Caution: <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D=
"segment-code-inline">var editingPostId=3Dnull;</code> =E2=80=94 must NOT b=
e deleted (it's the next section). She selects UP TO it.</div><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Give the step. Also remind: after file 3, one comm=
it, then Build.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fad=
e scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-=
edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></=
div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=
=3D"toolcall-rollup__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb3=
1c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb=
31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Attagirl =
=E2=80=94 clean-up on the fly =F0=9F=92=AA</div><div class=3D"paragraph" di=
r=3D"auto"><strong class=3D"">Final paste: the brain (file 3).</strong></di=
v><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Ctrl+F<=
/strong> =E2=86=92 type <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" cla=
ss=3D"segment-code-inline">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D CAMERA</code> =E2=86=92 Enter (jumps you deep into the file=
, to the old camera JavaScript)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Click at the <strong>start</strong> of that marker line</div></li=
><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Ctrl+F</strong> again =
=E2=86=92 type <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"seg=
ment-code-inline">var editingPostId=3Dnull;</code> =E2=86=92 Enter =E2=86=
=92 <strong>Esc</strong> to close the find box (your cursor stays at that l=
ine)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Hold <strong>Shift=
</strong> and press the <strong>=E2=86=91 Up arrow once</strong>... actuall=
y simpler: Shift+Click at the very start of the <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" =
data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">var editingPostId=3Dnull=
;</code> line =E2=80=94 everything between the marker and that line gets se=
lected</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Delete</=
strong>, then paste <strong>all of file 3</strong></div></li></ol><div clas=
s=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F The golden rule: <code data=
-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">var edi=
tingPostId=3Dnull;</code> itself must <strong>survive</strong> =E2=80=94 it=
's the door to the next room. If that line gets eaten, the edit-post featur=
e dies.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Then: green <strong>Comm=
it changes</strong> button, default message, one commit. Then tell me =E2=
=80=94 we go to Hyperlift and hit <strong>Build</strong> together, and your=
 gold camera goes live =F0=9F=8E=AC=F0=9F=92=9B</div></div></div></div> <di=
