cam-cap-actions" =E2=9C=93, Post/Retake buttons, cam-premium-actions with A=
dd to Story / Go Live, closing divs, and line 2387 <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D=
"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;/div&gt;</code> t=
hen line 2388 <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segm=
ent-code-inline">&lt;!-- LIGHTBOX --&gt;</code> and line 2389 the lightbox =
div.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">PERFECT =E2=80=94 the camer=
a overlay closes exactly one line before LIGHTBOX. File 2 is perfectly plac=
ed: starts at CAMERA OVERLAY (2298), ends at 2387, LIGHTBOX intact at 2388.=
</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She asks "Here?" =E2=80=94 prob=
ably asking whether this is the right spot / or where to do the next step (=
file 3 JS). Confirm: YES =E2=80=94 HTML block is perfectly closed. Now the =
JS paste (the instructions from my last message: find <code data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D CAMERA</code>, select to <cod=
e data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">v=
ar editingPostId=3Dnull;</code>, replace with file 3).</div><div class=3D"p=
aragraph" dir=3D"auto">Give her the green light + JS step concise. Also not=
e: don't commit until JS is in.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D=
"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div =
