"auto"><strong>PERFECT placement</strong> =E2=9C=85 =E2=80=94 look at line =
2387: the camera overlay closes with <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048c=
b31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;/div&gt;</code>, and <code data=
-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;!--=
