his narrow view =E2=80=94 which could be editingPostId/editPost/delPost/rep=
ost (long lines that wrap) and PROFILE marker!</div><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">Wait but in screenshot 4 (12.22.26) the left column was full=
y visible: 3784 postCam, 3785 blank, 3786 PROFILE. Hmm. In THAT screenshot,=
 numbers were clearly consecutive and legible.</div><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">Ugh. These conflicting views make it hard. The truth: I cann=
ot resolve her buffer state from these fragments. The DEFINITIVE answer com=
