c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">var editingPostId=3Dnull;</code>.</div=
><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She re-sent the same image with no t=
ext. Maybe she's saying "here?" again =E2=80=94 asking if this is the right=
