h" dir=3D"auto">So her buffer HAD v2 JS at 1:05. And v2 CSS/HTML presumably=
 from before. But NOW main shows NO v2?? But it shows the rescue blocks?</d=
iv><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">If she committed at ~1:10, main sh=
ould have v2. Unless... she committed and then REVERTED? Or the commit only=
 included part? GitHub commits the whole file.</div><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto">OR =E2=80=94 did she click "Cancel changes" AFTER pasting ev=
erything, losing v2, but the rescue commit happened in a PREVIOUS session? =
Hmm: maybe she did TWO commits: first commit (rescue bits from earlier sess=
ion at ~12:56-1:00), then pasted v2 files... no wait.</div><div class=3D"pa=
ragraph" dir=3D"auto">Actually the simplest read: the commit that landed co=
ntained: her buffer =3D original main + rescue blocks (editingPostId remain=
der + profile block) =E2=80=94 WITHOUT the v2 camera files. The 1:05 screen=
shots showed v2 in the buffer... then maybe she hit Cancel (discarding v2!)=
