om the GLITCHED session (which HAD v2 CSS+HTML from the morning Chromebook =
work =E2=80=94 the 8:09 screenshots showed v2 CSS at 651 and v2 HTML at 229=
8 in that session!)...</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"=
>WAIT. The 8:06-8:09 session: she pasted file 1 + file 2 (screenshots showe=
d v2 CSS at 651 and v2 HTML at 2298). I then told her to Cancel because the=
 edit block was missing. Did she Cancel? She went silent, came back at 12:2=
