xactly 1 renderProfile. Clean.</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Hmm, so where did rescue get committed? Current main HAS the resc=
ue additions?? Wait =E2=80=94 does it? Original main ALREADY had editingPos=
tId/editPost/delPost/repost/profile section =E2=80=94 I verified that at 8:=
15 AM ("main has edit-block between camera and profile: True"). So main ALW=
AYS had them! The current check showing =E2=9C=85 for all rescue items is j=
ust... main being main!</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Oh no. S=
o NOTHING new is committed?! But file size 416,047 vs original ~416k... The=
 original download at 5:40 was what size? I don't have it recorded precisel=
y, but similar. So possibly she committed nothing new, or committed somethi=
ng tiny.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">BUT the 1:05 screenshot=
s showed v2 in her buffer =E2=80=94 with "Commit changes..." button availab=
le. If she clicked Cancel afterwards (or the session died), v2 never landed=
.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Hmm wait =E2=80=94 but she ask=
