raph" dir=3D"auto">Okay boss, full report from the code inspection =E2=80=
=94 good news first, then a plot twist:</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">=E2=9C=85 <strong>Your repo is safe.</strong> Nothing broken ship=
ped. Site's intact, old camera works, all the edit-post/profile code presen=
t.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=98=85 <strong>But here=
's the twist:</strong> the commit you made at 1:06 ("Update fmt.Println mes=
sage from 'Hello' to 'Goodbye'") =E2=80=94 <strong>that wasn't the camera.<=
/strong> That's a <em>Go programming file</em> change (fmt.Println is not e=
ven the language your site uses), and at 1:10 it got merged as Pull Request=
 #8. That has Copilot's fingerprints all over it =E2=80=94 it sidetracked y=
ou into merging its own little PR instead of committing your camera work. D=
=C3=A9j=C3=A0 vu from yesterday's PR adventure =F0=9F=98=84</div><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=E2=9D=8C <strong>Your camera v2 edits never go=
t committed</strong> =E2=80=94 the index.html changes are sitting in an edi=
tor session (or lost to the ether).</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to"><strong>The path forward (third time's the charm, and it's a 10-minute =
job):</strong></div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"aut=
o">Open a <strong>fresh</strong> editor session: <a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" ta=
rget=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/edit/m=
ain/index.html" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">https://github.com/myc=
hainlinkCA/Mychainlink/edit/main/index.html</a></div></li><li><div class=3D=
"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Do the three pastes (landmarks: CSS <code data-v-b=
faabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">/* =3D=3D=
=3D CAMERA</code>=E2=86=92before <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=
=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">/* =3D=3D=3D PROFILE</code>; HTML <code=
 data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&l=
t;!-- CAMERA OVERLAY --&gt;</code>=E2=86=92before <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"=
