;</code>; JS <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segme=
nt-code-inline">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D CAMERA</code>=E2=86=92before <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb=
31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">var editingPostId=3Dnull;</code>)</d=
iv></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">This time, when you hit <=
strong>Commit changes</strong> =E2=80=94 check that the box says <strong>in=
dex.html</strong> and only index.html</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph=
" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Politely decline any Copilot suggestions</strong> un=
til we're done =F0=9F=98=82 =E2=80=94 it's a helpful little gremlin but it =
keeps merging its own homework into your repo. We'll evict its Go file when=
 Claw has hands again (it's harmless until then =E2=80=94 your Docker build=
 only runs Node).</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The =
three files are still right here in our chat, ready. Fresh session, three p=
astes, one clean commit =E2=80=94 and then we Build and you finally meet yo=
ur gold camera =F0=9F=8E=AC=F0=9F=92=9B</div></div></div></div></div></div>=
