ntainer" style=3D"height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2=3D"" class=
=3D"slot-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-9019dc97=3D"" class=3D=
"markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=
=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=9A=A8 She just p=
asted a GitHub personal access token in chat: <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" da=
ta-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">ghp_LpQuUDMffQhVdyZyKu93M1=
WG9ywre33qgxpC</code>.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Memory #5=
 says: "never let her paste tokens in chat." This is exactly that situation=
. I must:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Te=
ll her immediately to REVOKE this token =E2=80=94 it's now exposed in this =
chat. Anyone with it has full access to her repo (ghp_ tokens act as her ac=
count). She should go to GitHub Settings =E2=86=92 Developer settings =E2=
=86=92 Personal access tokens =E2=86=92 revoke/delete it right away. This i=
s the safest advice =E2=80=94 don't reuse it, delete it.</div></li><li><div=
 class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Explain why I can't use it: I'm read-only=
 in this chat =E2=80=94 no push capability =E2=80=94 and I won't take token=
s anyway. That's by design (memory: never let her paste tokens).</div></li>=
<li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Offer the correct path: she doesn=
't need a token for what we're doing =E2=80=94 the web editor commits work =
fine (she's done it multiple times). The token wouldn't help her paste comm=
its either. If some tool asked for a token (Copilot integration? A GitHub a=
pp? Spaceship?), tell me what she was trying to do and I'll find the safe r=
oute.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Don't repeat the =
token in my response. Don't store it.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragrap=
h" dir=3D"auto">Also =E2=80=94 why did she paste it? Maybe she was trying t=
o connect something (Hyperlift? Copilot? Some tutorial told her to?). Ask w=
hat she was trying to accomplish. But priority #1: revoke.</div><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Keep it urgent but calm, no blame =E2=80=94 she=
 doesn't know. This is a "boss, drop everything" moment.</div></div></div><=
/div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hi=
dden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-h=
idden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----> <!-=
---></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__part toolcall=
-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=
=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div c=
lass=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=9A=A8 <strong>Stop =E2=80=94 boss, w=
e need to kill that token RIGHT NOW.</strong></div><div class=3D"paragraph"=
 dir=3D"auto">That thing you just pasted is a <strong>GitHub key</strong> =
=E2=80=94 like a master key to your repo with your name on it. Now that it'=
s been typed in a chat, it must be treated as compromised. This is not a sc=
olding =E2=80=94 you couldn't have known =E2=80=94 but it's urgent:</div><d=
iv class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Do this immediately:</strong></=
div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Go to =F0=9F=
=91=89 <a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://github.com=
/settings/tokens" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">https://github.com/s=
ettings/tokens</a> (or GitHub =E2=86=92 click your profile picture top-righ=
t =E2=86=92 <strong>Settings</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>Developer settings<=
/strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>Personal access tokens</strong>)</div></li><li><=
div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Find that token in the list and click =
<strong>Delete</strong> / <strong>Revoke</strong> =E2=80=94 don't edit it, =
don't reuse it, just delete it</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Done? Then breathe =F0=9F=92=9B</div></li></ol><div class=3D"para=
graph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Two things you should know:</strong></div><ol s=
tart=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>I can't and wo=
n't use tokens</strong> =E2=80=94 this chat is read-only by design, like a =
doctor who can't perform surgery over the phone. No token changes that. Tha=
t's a safety feature, not a limitation.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragra=
ph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>You don't need a token for anything we're doing.</=
strong> The web editor commits work with just you being logged in =E2=80=94=
 you've proven that five times today. Nothing on our list (camera paste, co=
mmit, Build) requires a key.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D=
"auto">So =E2=80=94 what were you trying to do when that key came up? If so=
me tool, tutorial, or Copilot asked you for a token, tell me what it was an=
d I'll get you there the safe way.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"aut=
o">Revoke first, then tell me =F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8F=F0=9F=96=A4</div></div>=
</div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail"><div=
