a-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
The ipython results got hidden ("=E5=8E=86=E5=8F=B2tool_call=E5=B7=B2=E9=9A=
=90=E8=97=8F" pattern), but she interrupted anyway with a decision: "just h=
and over whats supposed to be there so i can copy and paste on the main bra=
nch then."</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">She's made the right =
call =E2=80=94 pasting on main directly. She wants the three files re-deliv=
ered (or confirmed) so she can copy-paste on main.</div><div class=3D"parag=
raph" dir=3D"auto">She knows the landmarks by heart now. Give her:</div><ol=
 start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Quick validation: go=
od decision, that's the safe path.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" d=
ir=3D"auto">The three files (they're already delivered earlier =E2=80=94 fi=
les 1, 2, 3). Re-tag them for convenience.</div></li><li><div class=3D"para=
graph" dir=3D"auto">The exact landmarks + order.</div></li><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Reminder: verify address bar says edit/main/, c=
ommit only index.html, ignore Copilot.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragra=
ph" dir=3D"auto">Keep it tight =E2=80=94 she wants to execute. Maybe combin=
e the CSS+HTML+JS into... no, three separate pastes is the plan. Re-referen=
ce the three files with REF tags (they were delivered before; re-tagging sa=
me paths is fine and helpful).</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">N=
ote: it's now Sept 15, 05:30 +08:00 (14:30 PDT Sept 14) =E2=80=94 she's bac=
k at it.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Also note: since ipytho=
n output was hidden, I don't have the branch-vs-main diff results visible, =
but no matter =E2=80=94 she's chosen the main path which is right regardles=
s.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge=
-fade-bottom" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-mea=
sure-sentinel" aria-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></d=
iv></div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-=
rollup__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-=
v-8fac2c49=3D"" class=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" clas=
s=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">That's the winning mov=
e, boss =E2=80=94 main branch, fresh editor, and this is the FINAL lap. Her=
e's everything, laid out clean:</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
<strong>The three files</strong> (download each, then paste in this order):=
</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=8E=
=A8 <strong>Wardrobe (CSS)</strong> =E2=80=94 search <code data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">/* =3D=3D=3D CAMER=
A</code> =E2=86=92 select to just before <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-=
048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">/* =3D=3D=3D PROFILE</code> =E2=
=86=92 replace with file 1</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to">=F0=9F=A6=B4 <strong>Skeleton (HTML)</strong> =E2=80=94 search <code da=
ta-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;!=
-- CAMERA OVERLAY --&gt;</code> =E2=86=92 select to just before <code data-=
v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">&lt;!-- =
LIGHTBOX --&gt;</code> =E2=86=92 replace with file 2</div></li><li><div cla=
ss=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=A7=A0 <strong>Brain (JS)</strong> =E2=
=80=94 search <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segm=
ent-code-inline">// =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D CAMERA</code> =E2=86=92 select to just before <code data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">var editingPostId=
=3Dnull;</code> =E2=86=92 replace with file 3</div></li></ol><div class=3D"=
paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Before you start, one check:</strong> the a=
ddress bar must say <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=
=3D"segment-code-inline">.../edit/main/index.html</code> =E2=80=94 if it sa=
ys anything with "patch" in it, you're on the wrong road. Close it and use =
this exact link: <a data-v-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://=
github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/edit/main/index.html" rel=3D"noreferre=
r nofollow noopener" class=3D"">https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlin=
k/edit/main/index.html</a></div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><stro=
ng>After the three pastes, before Commit:</strong></div><ul start=3D"1"><li=
><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Ctrl+F <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" da=
ta-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">id=3D"cam-o"</code> =E2=86=
=92 1 match</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Ctrl+F <cod=
e data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">C=
AMERA v2</code> =E2=86=92 found</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=
=3D"auto">Ctrl+F <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"s=
egment-code-inline">var editingPostId=3Dnull;</code> =E2=86=92 found</div><=
/li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The commit box says <strong>i=
ndex.html</strong> only =E2=86=92 Commit</div></li></ul><div class=3D"parag=
raph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>Then come back here</strong> =E2=80=94 we hit Bu=
ild in Hyperlift together and you finally meet the gold camera. And if Copi=
lot taps you on the shoulder mid-surgery, it can wait its turn =F0=9F=98=A4=
=F0=9F=92=9B</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><div data-v-2c98bfe=
