class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">JS: v2 confirmed.</div></li><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">What does the site currently serve? (mychainlin=
k.ca fetch)</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Also check=
 commits since 13:11 to see what happened.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" di=
r=3D"auto">Then: if main =3D old CSS + new HTML/JS, I need to deliver the C=
SS swap =E2=80=94 which is the smallest fix: she only needs file 1 (CSS) no=
w! The full-file replacement approach still works but maybe overkill; still=
 cleanest: give her the FULL corrected index.html (base =3D current main, r=
eplace CSS block with v2, HTML block with v2 (idempotent), JS block with v2=
 (idempotent), favicon bump, OG tags). Idempotent replacements on current m=
ain =3D safe either way.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">But car=
eful: if main's HTML is ALREADY v2, my replacement [CAMERA OVERLAY, LIGHTBO=
X) =E2=86=92 v2 HTML is idempotent. If it's still old, it fixes it. Same fo=
r JS. The CSS: current main has old CSS =E2=86=92 v2 CSS applied.</div><div=
 class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Also verify the HTML state of main first.=
 Let me diagnose fully, then assemble final from CURRENT main, then deliver=
 with upload instructions.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class=3D"scro=
