=9C=85, main =E2=9D=8C LOST</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"a=
uto">editingPostId: both =E2=9C=85</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" d=
ir=3D"auto">repost: both =E2=9C=85</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" d=
ir=3D"auto">acceptTos / m-tos / sendMediaMsg / openLiveModal: both =E2=9C=
=85</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">addToStory: neither=
 (fine, named differently =E2=80=94 'Add to Story' button calls addToStory?=
 both False =E2=80=94 so my earlier HTML references addToStory()... wait, i=
n my file-2 HTML I have onclick=3D"addToStory()" =E2=80=94 if the function =
