d =E2=9C=85, main =E2=9D=8C LOST (that's why renderProfile etc. vanished =
=E2=80=94 the whole PROFILE section is gone from main)</div></li></ul><div =
class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">So the merge damage on main: <strong>entir=
e PROFILE JS section deleted</strong> + camera JS replaced with v2 (with th=
e broken single-slash marker) + CSS/HTML apparently old (from the earlier c=
hecks: CSS old, HTML old).</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The f=
ix I already assembled (<code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" cla=
ss=3D"segment-code-inline">doc</code>) was built from <code data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">base</code> =3D cu=
rrent main =E2=80=94 which LACKS the PROFILE section. So my assembled doc i=
s ALSO missing renderProfile etc. That explains 'profile intact': =E2=9D=8C=
.</div><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">BUT =E2=80=94 the tool budget =
is now exhausted. I cannot rebuild or re-verify. What do I have?</div><ul s=
tart=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><code data-v-bfaabce6=
=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-inline">/mnt/agents/output=
/index.html</code> =E2=80=94 written from current main; MISSING the PROFILE=
 JS section. NOT deliverable as-is.</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" =
dir=3D"auto">I DO have the rescue PROFILE block saved earlier: <code data-v=
