a-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">=
She asks where to drag the banner (og-image.png). Simple clarification:</di=
v><ol start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Go to <a data-v=
-048cb31c=3D"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/M=
ychainlink/upload/main" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">https://github=
.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/upload/main</a></div></li><li><div class=3D"=
paragraph" dir=3D"auto">On that page there's a big drop zone ("Drag files h=
ere to add them to your repository") =E2=80=94 drag BOTH files there (index=
.html AND og-image.png together, or one after the other =E2=80=94 both must=
 appear in the file list).</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"au=
to">The files will show up in a list below the drop zone.</div></li><li><di=
v class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Then click the green "Commit changes" bu=
tton.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Both files in ON=
E commit. Then the profile paste. Keep it short, one step.</div></div></div=
></div></div> <div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-=
hidden=3D"true"></div><div class=3D"scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria=
-hidden=3D"true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----> <=
!----></div><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcall-rollup__part toolca=
ll-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" data-v-8fac2c49=3D"" cla=
ss=3D"markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"markdown"><div=
 class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Super simple:</div><ol start=3D"1"><li><d=
iv class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Open =F0=9F=91=89 <a data-v-048cb31c=3D=
"" target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://github.com/mychainlinkCA/Mychainlink/u=
pload/main" rel=3D"noreferrer nofollow noopener">https://github.com/mychain=
linkCA/Mychainlink/upload/main</a></div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" d=
ir=3D"auto">You'll see a big box that says <strong>"Drag files here to add =
them to your repository"</strong> =E2=80=94 drag <strong>both</strong> file=
s into that box:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"a=
uto"><code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=3D"segment-code-=
inline">index.html</code> (the finished one)</div></li><li><div class=3D"pa=
ragraph" dir=3D"auto"><code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" class=
=3D"segment-code-inline">og-image.png</code> (the golden banner)</div></li>=
</ul><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">(One at a time or both together =
=E2=80=94 just make sure they both appear in the list under the box.)</div>=
</li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Scroll down and click the gr=
een <strong>Commit changes</strong> button =E2=80=94 one commit, both files=
.</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Then the one small p=
aste (rescue file before the SETTINGS line) and we Build. Almost home, boss=
 =F0=9F=8F=81=F0=9F=92=9B</div></div></div></div> <div data-v-0a722276=3D""=
 class=3D"toolcall-rollup__tail"><div data-v-0a722276=3D"" class=3D"toolcal=
l-rollup__tail-in"><!----></div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> =
